== Walkthrough ==

Find [[Miranda]] in the [[Stonebrunt Mountains]], located in the Kejekan camp.

You say, 'Hail, Miranda'

: Miranda says 'I'm not supposed to talk to strangers but if my parents let you in here I guess it's ok. Do you like [candy]? I could give you some candy to play a game with me but my [dice] are gone now.'

You say, 'What candy?'

: Miranda says 'Khonza Ayssla went away one time and came back with chocolate covered cherries and pixie powder cinnesticks for my sister and I. I like the chocolates the best.'

Miranda would like some [[Chocolate Marr Cherries]], which are made from three [[Marr Cherries]] and one [[Winter Chocolate]] (126 trivial baking).

[[Marr Cherries]] are foraged in the [[Ocean of Tears]] (droppable), while [[Winter Chocolate]] is made from 1 [[Brownie Parts]] and 2 [[Frosting]] (95 trivial [[baking]]).

Miranda claps her hands with excitement 'Chocolate cherries!! My favorite!! 
Here try some of this!!'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Kejek Village]] has been adjusted by 1.
* Your faction standing with [[Peace Keepers]] has been adjusted by 1.

{{exp}}
</div>

In exchange for the cherries, Miranda gives you a [[Pouch of Kejek Catnip]], STA: -1, WIS: +5.

Note: You can't turn in 4 at a time - she will eat 3 of them and only give you 1 kejek catnip.

